# Copy to .env.local for a local override, or set in your deploy platform's
# environment variable settings (e.g. Netlify: Site configuration ->
# Environment variables). Vite only exposes vars prefixed VITE_, and inlines
# them at BUILD time -- changing this after a deploy requires a rebuild, not
# just a page refresh.

# Leave unset for local dev: vite.config.js already proxies API paths to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000, so requests work with no configuration.
#
# Set to the backend's public origin for a deployed build, no trailing slash:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-name.ngrok-free.app
